    {
      "id": "XV8omgjFgBasQkoLIk2e7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -732.6630534022304,
      "y": 82555.16989027405,
      "width": 583,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b71",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2007252005,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 807729899,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791264621790,
      "created": 1791264578185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Next question — Django ORM\nSuppose:\nProject\n   ↓ ForeignKey\nTeam\n   ↓ ForeignKey\nOrganization\n\nWe want to fetch projects and access:\nproject.team.organization.name\n\n\nWhich is the better approach?\nA) Use select_related(\"team\", \"team__organization\")\nB) Use prefetch_related(\"team\", \"team__organization\")\nC) Run a separate query inside the loop\nD) Fetch everything in Redis\n👉 Your answer?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Next question — Django ORM\nSuppose:\nProject\n   ↓ ForeignKey\nTeam\n   ↓ ForeignKey\nOrganization\n\nWe want to fetch projects and access:\nproject.team.organization.name\n\n\nWhich is the better approach?\nA) Use select_related(\"team\", \"team__organization\")\nB) Use prefetch_related(\"team\", \"team__organization\")\nC) Run a separate query inside the loop\nD) Fetch everything in Redis\n👉 Your answer?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
